WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.372
Step 1. Open the template panel.

1.2
00:00:02.372 --> 00:00:06.814
You can change or delete a template, not only one that you created.

1.3
00:00:06.814 --> 00:00:12.088
In the Medication Request or Service Request question, select Templates.

2.1
00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:14.001
Step 2. Find the template.

2.2
00:00:14.001 --> 00:00:19.617
Enter a name in Search templates, and find the template that you want to change.

3.1
00:00:19.617 --> 00:00:25.270
Step 3. Open the template for editing. Select the edit icon on the template.

3.2
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:28.188
Care opens the Edit Template form.

4.1
00:00:28.188 --> 00:00:34.238
Step 4. Change the template. Remove items with the cross icon, or change the name,

4.2
00:00:34.238 --> 00:00:42.382
the description or the departments. This form cannot add items.

5.1
00:00:42.382 --> 00:00:45.975
Step 5. Save the changes. Select Save Changes.

5.2
00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:52.144
Care shows Template updated successfully and returns to the list of templates.

6.1
00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.297
Step 6. Delete the template.

6.2
00:00:54.297 --> 00:00:59.054
Select the delete icon on the template, then select Delete to confirm.

6.3
00:00:59.054 --> 00:01:04.039
You cannot undo this, and the template no longer shows for anyone.
